 ## Background
-VoxelBlockyModelMesh is part of the Voxel Tools suite for the Godot Engine [S1]. It was developed to provide a more versatile workflow for voxel terrain and object creation, moving beyond simple cube-based geometry [S2]. The method leverages Godot's mesh resource system and integrates with the existing blocky meshing infrastructure, including face culling and greedy merging [G].
+VoxelBlockyModelMesh is part of the Voxel Tools suite for the Godot Engine [S1, S2]. It was developed to provide a more versatile workflow for voxel terrain and object creation, moving beyond simple cube-based geometry [G]. The method leverages Godot's mesh resource system and integrates with the existing blocky meshing infrastructure, including face culling and greedy merging [S1, S2].
 
